Transcript:'Birds-Eye' Jack.wikitext:
{{Transcript|npc}}

== On the Lady Zay after docking at Lunar Isle ==
* '''Player:''' I feel a little sea-sick from this travelling.
* ''' 'Birds-Eye' Jack:''' Well there's a good remedy for that.
* '''Player:''' There is?
* ''' 'Birds-Eye' Jack:''' Yes.
* '''Player:''' What?
* ''' 'Birds-Eye' Jack:''' Swim.
* '''Player:''' Oh HA HA. Thanks for the help!
* ''' 'Birds-Eye' Jack:''' My pleasure.
* '''Player:''' I was being sarcastic.
* ''' 'Birds-Eye' Jack:''' I know. So was I.
* {{tact|end}}

== At Lunar Isle bank ==
* {{tselect|What would you like to talk about?}}
* {{topt|Using the bank}}
** {{tselect|What would you like to say?}}
** {{topt|I'd like to access my bank account, please.}}
*** '''Player:''' I'd like to access my bank account, please.
*** {{tact|Bank interface opens.}}
** {{topt|I'd like to collect items.}}
*** '''Player:''' I'd like to collect items.
*** {{tact|Grand Exchange collection interface opens.}}
** {{topt|I'd like to check my PIN settings.}}
*** '''Player:''' I'd like to check my PIN settings.
*** {{tact|Pin settings interface opens.}}
** {{topt|What is this place?}}
*** '''Player:''' What is this place?
*** ''' 'Bird's-Eye' Jack:''' This is a branch of the Bank of Gielinor. We have branches in many towns.
*** '''Player:''' And what do you do?
*** ''' 'Bird's-Eye' Jack:''' We will look after your items and money for you. Leave your valuables with us if you want to keep them safe.
*** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Cyrisus in the mine}}
** '''Player:''' Hi.
** ''' 'Bird's-Eye' Jack:''' How's Cyrisus? Where is he?
** '''Player:''' He's fine now. Back to full health.
** ''' 'Bird's-Eye' Jack:''' Good, I'm pleased.
** '''Player:''' No problem.
** ''' 'Bird's-Eye' Jack:''' Don't think that this means I like you now!
** '''Player:''' Look at my face.
** ''' 'Bird's-Eye' Jack:''' Yes? What about it.
** '''Player:''' Does it look like I care?
** ''' 'Bird's-Eye' Jack:''' Not really.
** '''Player:''' Well, there you go.
** {{tact|end}}

Transcript:'Black-eye'.wikitext:
{{Transcript|npc}}

==Standard dialogue== 
===Before [[Tower of Life]]===
* '''Player:''' What's going on?
* '''<nowiki>'Black-eye':</nowiki>''' Ah, we be building this 'ere tower. Lookin' good ain't it?
* '''Player:''' It does look pretty impressive, but what are you doing hanging around?
* '''<nowiki>'Black-eye':</nowiki>''' Tea break, naturally.
* '''Player:''' Naturally. Not sure why I asked.
* '''<nowiki>'Black-eye':</nowiki>''' Fancy some?
* '''Player:''' Tea? Sure.
* '''<nowiki>'Black-eye':</nowiki>''' You'll find a kettle in the box to the-
* '''Player:''' Erm...yeah...no...sorry...gotta go.
* {{tact|end}}

===After [[Tower of Life]]===
* '''Player:''' Say, that's a nice helmet.
* {{tcond|Player does not have a [[Hard hat]] in bank or inventory:}}
** '''<nowiki>'Black-eye'</nowiki>:''' Why, thanks.
** '''Player:''' I was just wondering if you might be able to help me out with one?
** '''<nowiki>'Black-eye'</nowiki>:''' Always glad to help a budding builder. But first, prove your Construction knowledge by answering some questions.
** '''<nowiki>'Black-eye'</nowiki>:''' How many nails does it take to make a rocking chair?
** {{tselect|Select an option}}
** {{topt|One}}
*** '''Player:''' One?
*** '''<nowiki>'Black-eye'</nowiki>:''' One? How do you suppose you'd use a single nail?
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{topt|Five}}
*** '''Player:''' Five?
*** '''<nowiki>'Black-eye'</nowiki>:''' Nope. Keep guessing!
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{topt|Three}}
*** '''Player:''' Three?
*** '''<nowiki>'Black-eye'</nowiki>:''' Bingo! Okay, now what takes 3 planks, 3 cloths and 3 nails to make, and helps remove light from a room?
*** {{tselect|Select an option}}
*** {{topt|Torn curtains}}
**** '''Player:''' Torn curtains?
**** '''<nowiki>'Black-eye'</nowiki>:''' Nice one. Last question: I like fish and I want to put some in my garden, but I need a special water feature. What materials would I require?
**** {{tselect|Select an option}}
**** {{topt|8 clay pieces and 3 limestone bricks}}
***** '''Player:''' 8 clay pieces and 3 limestone bricks?
***** '''<nowiki>'Black-eye'</nowiki>:''' Oh, and you were so close!
***** {{tact|end}}
**** {{topt|10 clay pieces}}
***** '''Player:''' 10 clay pieces?
***** '''<nowiki>'Black-eye'</nowiki>:''' That's it! You seem to know your stuff. I got a spare helmet from a builder that died on... I mean, err, had to leave the job for greener pastures.
***** '''Player:''' Greener pastures?
***** '''Player:''' Fair enough.
***** {{tact|receives=Hard hat}}
***** '''Player:''' Wait a minute! Is there blood on this helmet?
***** '''<nowiki>'Black-eye'</nowiki>:''' Erm, no, that's just, erm, paint. Yes, paint! That's what it is!
***** '''Player:''' Oh, okay. Thanks. Bye.
***** '''<nowiki>'Black-eye'</nowiki>:''' Ha, gullible fool.
***** '''Player:''' What?
***** '''<nowiki>'Black-eye'</nowiki>:''' Nothing.
***** {{tact|end}}
**** {{topt|10 limestone bricks}}
***** '''Player:''' 10 limestone bricks?
***** '''<nowiki>'Black-eye'</nowiki>:''' Guess again.
***** {{tact|end}}
*** {{topt|A brown rug}}
**** '''Player:''' A brown rug?
**** '''<nowiki>'Black-eye'</nowiki>:''' Of course, because that's what everyone needs - a rug up at their window.
**** {{tact|end}}
*** {{topt|Opulent curtains}}
**** '''Player:''' Opulent curtains?
**** '''<nowiki>'Black-eye'</nowiki>:''' Those curtains are not going to be in any way opulent, matey.
**** {{tact|end}}
* {{tcond|Player has [[Hard hat]] in bank:}}
** '''<nowiki>'Black-eye':</nowiki>''' Thank you - just as nice as the one in your bank!
** {{tact|end}}
* {{tcond|Player has [[Hard hat]] in inventory:}}
** '''<nowiki>'Black-eye'</nowiki>:''' Yes - just as nice as the one you're carrying I'd say.
** {{tact|end}}

