Transcript:Aeonisig Raispher.wikitext:
{{Transcript|npc}}

==Standard dialogue==
* '''Aeonisig Raispher:''' Please only talk to the King if it's important. He has a heavy burden to bear with the running of his kingdom.
* {{tselect|Select an option}}
* {{topt|Who are you?}}
** '''Player:''' Who are you?
** '''Aeonisig Raispher:''' Apologies! Allow me to introduce myself. My name is Aeonisig Raispher, special advisor to King Roald on spiritual matters.
** '''Player:''' Special advisor on spiritual matters? What does that mean?
** '''Aeonisig Raispher:''' It means that some decisions the King has to make might have unforeseen repercussions on Misthalin's spiritual sensibilities. My duty is to ensure that Saradominist ideals are not stomped underfoot.
** '''Player:''' I see...
** {{tact|other}}
* {{topt|What do you do here?}}
** '''Player:''' What do you do here?
** '''Aeonisig Raispher:''' My main function is to ensure that King Roald is apprised of all options, especially when it comes to any potential impacts on the righteous followers of Saradomin.
** '''Player:''' But surely the King should be able to make his own decisions on what's best for Misthalin?
** '''Aeonisig Raispher:''' What an interesting perspective you have! Totally unworkable of course, but interesting nonetheless.
** {{tact|other}}
* {{topt|Where did you come from?}}
** '''Player:''' Where did you come from?
** '''Aeonisig Raispher:''' I took my religious and combat training in several parts of the known world. I've also fought despicable beasts in the Wilderness in Saradomin's name.
** '''Aeonisig Raispher:''' Needless to say, I have great experience in the ways of the world and am an invaluable aid to the King's decision-making process.
** {{tact|other}}
* {{topt|How did you come to be an advisor to King Roald?}}
** '''Player:''' How did you come to be an advisor to King Roald?
** '''Aeonisig Raispher:''' The King of Misthalin, like any great leader, always requires the best advice and the best advisors.
** '''Aeonisig Raispher:''' He very often summons occasional advisors to help him in certain situations, but it was felt by the Church of Saradomin that a full time advisor on religious matters was needed.
** '''Player:''' How come he doesn't have an advisor for any other religious denominations?
** '''Aeonisig Raispher:''' Other religious denominations? The ruling of a kingdom is no place for pagan cults and their intolerable beliefs! We do things properly here, thank you very much.
** {{tact|other}}
* {{topt|cond=If the player did not select any other dialogue options:|Fair enough.}}
** '''Player:''' Fair enough.
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|cond=If the player selected at least one other dialogue option:|I'd best be off.}}
** '''Player:''' I'd best be off.
** {{tact|end}}

