** '''Ali the Leaflet Dropper:''' The flyer advertises the different shops you can find in Al Kharid.
** '''Ali the Leaflet Dropper:''' It also entitles you to money off your next purchase in any of the shops listed on it. It's Ali's way of getting on the good side of the traders.
** '''Player:''' Which shops?
** {{tcond|If the player does not have an [[Al kharid flyer]]:}}
*** {{tact|receives=[[Al kharid flyer]]}}
