** '''Ali the Leaflet Dropper:''' Apart from a busy and wonderous market place in Al Kharid to the south, there is the Emir's Arena to the south-east where you can challenge other players to a fight.
** '''Ali the Leaflet Dropper:''' If you're here to make money, there is a mine to the south.
** '''Ali the Leaflet Dropper:''' Watch out for scorpions though, they'll take a pop at you if you go too near them. To avoid them just follow the western fence as you travel south.
** '''Ali the Leaflet Dropper:''' If you're in the mood for a little rest and relaxation, there are a couple of nice fishing spots south of the town.
