Transcript:Andros Mai.wikitext:
{{Transcript|npc}}

==Standard dialogue==
* {{topt|You look ready for combat.}}
** '''Player:''' Well met, fellow adventurer.
** '''Andros Mai:''' Adventurer? I am no mere Adventurer, I am Andros Mai, brother of the Holy Order of Saradomin. You would do well to greet me with respect.
** '''Player:''' Andros Mai? Sorry, but I can't say I've heard of you I'm afraid.
** '''Andros Mai:''' I wouldn't have expected someone of your... stature to know of me.
** '''Andros Mai:''' Tell me, what do you know of the vile Vet'ion?
** {{tcond|With no [[Vet'ion]] kills:}}
*** '''Player:''' Nothing, but I have a feeling you're about to fill me in.
*** {{tact|continues}}
** {{tcond|With at least one [[Vet'ion]] kill:}}
*** '''Player:''' We've crossed swords in the past, I can't say I'm too keen to do it again though.
*** '''Andros Mai:''' You challenged him and came out unscathed? Impossible.
*** '''Player:''' I'm stronger than I look.
*** '''Player:''' But why do you ask? What do you want with Vet'ion?
*** {{tact|continues}}
** '''Andros Mai:''' Vet'ion was a devout follower of the heretical god Zamorak. It is the will of my order and my duty as a follower of the true god Saradomin to end his tyranny.
** '''Andros Mai:''' After many years in my order's libraries, I stumbled upon an old tome which mentioned Vet'ion's final resting place, which I believe to be his source of power.
** '''Andros Mai:''' His very existence is an insult to my lord Saradomin and I will not suffer it to exist any longer.
** '''Player:''' Then why are you waiting here? Seems to me that you don't want to face Vet'ion.
** '''Andros Mai:''' I have no fear of Vet'ion!
** '''Andros Mai:''' I am merely meditating and preparing for the battle. I need to focus my mind before going out to find his resting place.
** '''Player:''' It's okay, sometimes I pretend to be busy when there's something I don't want to do, too.
** '''Andros Mai:''' This conversation is over! Leave me before I lose my temper.
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Ask about rare item.|cond=If the player has [[Viggora's chainmace]] or the [[Claws of Callisto]]:}}
** {{tcond|With only Viggora's chainmace in the inventory:}}
