*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If the player has an active gravestone inside Vampyrium, but cannot afford the payment:}}
*** '''Aranei scout:''' I'm afraid you lack the required payment for me to do so, my friend. I will accept either a vial of blood, 150 stymphike feathers or 50,000 coins.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If the player has an active gravestone inside Vampyrium and can afford the payment:}}
*** '''Aranei scout:''' Of course.
*** {{tbox|The scout collects your gravestone and leaves it nearby.}}
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If the player has an active gravestone outside of Vampyrium:}}
