==Big Mo's May==
===Initial dialogue===
* '''Big Mo:''' Why, hello there!
* '''Player:''' Who are you?
* '''Big Mo:''' The name is Big Mo. I'm a travelling salesman and businessman from overseas.
* '''Big Mo:''' I drop by these parts every so often to see what wares I can get my hands on.
* '''Player:''' What do you mean by 'overseas'? Karamja?
* '''Big Mo:''' Ha! It seems you've got a lot of the world left to explore. hey, maybe I could help you with that.
* {{tselect|Select an Option}}
* {{topt|Exploration? I'm listening...}}
** '''Player:''' Exploration? I'm listening...
** '''Big Mo:''' When I buy stock, I buy almost everything I can get my hands on. I always end up finding clue scrolls mixed in with my stock.
** '''Big Mo:''' Usually my little brother would follow up on them, often coming back with a big pile of loot.
** '''Big Mo:''' Unfortunately, my brother got wrapped up in some nasty dealings with some faulty dragon claws so we had to part ways.
** '''Big Mo:''' Since you seem interested in an adventure, you seem like the perfect [man/woman] for the job!
