** '''Player:''' How are thing's here?
** '''Calin:''' Well, I'd be lying if I said life was suddenly perfect, but it's nice to no longer live in constant fear of the vampyres.
** '''Player:''' What will you do now that you don't have to worry about them?
** '''Calin:''' Well, quite a few of us are working on making the town a bit nicer. Not that there's anything wrong with the work you did of course.
** '''Calin:''' Some of the others don't want to stick around. They reckon it might be safe enough to make the journey up to Paterdomus now. I think they want to start a new life across the Salve.
** '''Player:''' Is there anything I can do to help out?
** '''Calin:''' With the town? No, I don't think so. You've done enough to help us anyway.
** '''Calin:''' I suppose if you did want to help in some way though, you could maybe assist those who want to get to Paterdomus. The swamps can still be pretty dangerous.
