==At Tempoross Cove==
* '''Captain Pudi:''' What do you need, adventurer? There is a battle to fight!
* {{topt|How do I help?}}
** '''Player:''' How do I help?
** '''Captain Pudi:''' Get yerself a harpoon from the crate on the ship, then go fish around the island t' catch some harpoonfish. They make fer fine ammo against Tempoross!
** '''Captain Pudi:''' Once ye caught some, ye can cook 'em at the shrines on the island if ye want 'em to pack more of a punch. Then come back t' the ship an' load 'em in the ammunition crates next to the cannons.
** '''Captain Pudi:''' Our cannoneers will get t' firin' the harpoonfish at Tempoross. When it's weak an' submerges to recover its energy, get down to the jetty next t' the ship an' fish those spirit pools.
** '''Captain Pudi:''' Be quick with fishin' those spirit pools though, or it'll come back so strong we'll have to abandon the fight! With any luck, we'll weaken those spirit fish enough t' subdue Tempoross. Now get t' the fight, sailor!
** '''Player:''' Aye aye!
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|What should I watch out for?}}
** '''Player:''' What should I watch out for?
** '''Captain Pudi:''' If Tempoross electrocutes a cannon t' stop it from firin', ya better load your harpoonfish into the other ammunition crates t' keep them cannons firin' instead.
** '''Captain Pudi:''' Also, make sure t' grab a rope from the ship crates an' keep an eye out for big waves. We'll make sure t' shout about them. Then ye best quickly tether yerself t' an island totem pole or ship mast with that rope.
** '''Captain Pudi:''' If the waves break the totem pole or ship mast, ye can grab a hammer from the ship crates t' fix 'em up before the next big wave hits.
** '''Captain Pudi:''' Oh, an' keep an eye out for lightnin' clouds causin' fires. Get a bucket from the ship crates, fill it with water at a pump, and get t' puttin it out before it spreads.
** '''Captain Pudi:''' If ye get hit by the waves or fire, don't be surprised when ye lose those fish an' tools ye gathered. Now get t' the fight, sailor!
** '''Player:''' Aye aye!
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|I want to leave.}}
** '''Player:''' I want to leave.
** '''Captain Pudi:''' Really? You will receive no reward if you do.
** {{topt|Yes, I really want to leave.}}
*** '''Player:''' Yes, I really want to leave.
