** '''Denulth:''' We are the prince's elite troops! We keep Burthorpe secure!
** '''Denulth:''' The White Knights have overlooked us, until now! They are pouring money into their war against the Black Knights, they are looking for an excuse to stop our funding and I'm afraid they may have found it!
** '''Denulth:''' If we can not destroy the troll camp on Death Plateau then the Imperial Guard will be disbanded and Burthorpe will come under control of the White Knights. We can not let this happen!
** {{tact|initial}}
* {{topt|See you about Denulth!}}
