** '''Player:''' Can you tell me more about Wily cats?
** '''Felkrash:''' Of course!
** '''Felkrash:''' They're tougher, stronger and faster than other kinds of cats. They have superior hunting skills and can even catch butterflies and kalphite larvae.
** '''Player:''' So are there any drawbacks to owning them?
** '''Felkrash:''' Wily cats need lots more exercise, otherwise they'll get fat and lazy.
** '''Player:''' What's the best way to exercise them?
** '''Felkrash:''' Bring it hunting or take it to the Rat Pits regularly.
** '''Felkrash:''' Try and keep it happy too, wily cats can be a little nasty when they're cranky.
** '''Player:''' What happens if I neglect my cat? Not that I would!
** '''Felkrash:''' It'll get fat and lazy and become much worse at hunting. Plus, everyone will know you're a bad cat trainer.
** '''Player:''' Can I retrain my lazy cat?
** '''Felkrash:''' Yes, you can get your lazy cat back in shape with lots of rat catching. But you really shouldn't let things get that bad.
