Transcript:First Mate Deri.wikitext:
{{Transcript|npc}}

==Standard dialogue==
* '''First Mate Deri:''' What do you need, adventurer? There is a battle to fight!
* {{topt|How do I help?}}
** '''Player:''' How do I help?
** '''First Mate Deri:''' Get yerself a harpoon from the crate on the ship, then go fish around the island t' catch some harpoonfish. They make fer fine ammo against Tempoross!
** '''First Mate Deri:''' Once ye caught some, ye can cook 'em at the shrines on the island if ye want 'em to pack more of a punch. Then come back t' the ship an' load 'em in the ammunition crates next to the cannons.
** '''First Mate Deri:''' Our cannoneers will get t' firin' the harpoonfish at Tempoross. When it's weak an' submerges to recover its energy, get down to the jetty next t' the ship an' fish those spirit pools.
** '''First Mate Deri:''' Be quick with fishin' those spirit pools though, or it'll come back so strong we'll have to abandon the fight! With any luck, we'll weaken those spirit fish enough t' subdue Tempoross. Now get t' the fight, sailor!
** '''Player:''' Aye aye!
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|What should I watch out for?}}
** '''Player:''' What should I watch out for?
** '''First Mate Deri:''' If Tempoross electrocutes a cannon t' stop it from firin', ya better load your harpoonfish into the other ammunition crates t' keep them cannons firin' instead.
** '''First Mate Deri:''' Also, make sure t' grab a rope from the ship crates an' keep an eye out for big waves. We'll make sure t' shout about them. Then ye best quickly tether yerself t' an island totem pole or ship mast with that rope.
** '''First Mate Deri:''' If the waves break the totem pole or ship mast, ye can grab a hammer from the ship crates t' fix 'em up before the next big wave hits.
** '''First Mate Deri:''' Oh, an' keep an eye out for lightnin' clouds causin' fires. Get a bucket from the ship crates, fill it with water at a pump, and get t' puttin it out before it spreads.
** '''First Mate Deri:''' If ye get hit by the waves or fire, don't be surprised when ye lose those fish an' tools ye gathered. Now get t' the fight, sailor!
** '''Player:''' Aye aye!
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|I want to leave.}}
** '''Player:''' I want to leave.
** '''First Mate Deri:''' Really? You will receive no reward if you do.
** {{topt|Yes, I really want to leave.}}
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{topt|No, I don't want to leave.}}
*** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|I'll get on with the fighting.}}
** '''Player:''' I'll get on with the fighting.
** {{tact|end}}

===After subduing Tempoross===
* '''First Mate Deri:''' We did it! Tempoross has been sudbued once again. Well done!
* '''First Mate Deri:''' Take a well deserved rest but don't get too comfy, it'll regain its energy soon enough!
* {{topt|What should I do now?}}
** '''Player:''' What should I do now?
** '''First Mate Deri:''' We usually find some debris washed up near the docks back at Unkah. Feel free t' have a look. Ya might find somethin' useful!
** '''First Mate Deri:''' It won't be long before Tempoross regains enough energy to be a problem and we'll have to wrangle it again. Hopefully we can count on you to 'elp!
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|I'm ready to leave.}}
** '''Player:''' I'm ready to leave.
** '''First Mate Deri:''' Aye aye!
** {{Qact|The player returns to the [[Ruins of Unkah]].}}
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Goodbye.}}
** '''Player:''' Goodbye.
** {{tact|end}}

==Overhead dialogue==
* {{tcond|As soon as the mission begins:}}
** '''First Mate Deri:''' {{overhead|Tempoross will surface soon, prepare yourselves!}}
* {{tcond|Throughout the mission:}}
** {{trandom}}
** {{topt|Dialogue 1}}
*** '''First Mate Deri:''' {{overhead|More fish!}}
** {{topt|Dialogue 2}}
*** '''First Mate Deri:''' {{overhead|Load those cannons!}}
** {{topt|Dialogue 3}}
*** '''First Mate Deri:''' {{overhead|Keep an eye on the waves!}}
