Transcript:Guild Scribe Verity.wikitext:
{{Transcript|npc}}

==First time talking==
* '''Guild Scribe Verity:''' Oh, hello there newcomer. I'm Guild Scribe Verity. Do you need me to explain the work we do here?
* '''Player:''' Yes please.
* '''Guild Scribe Verity:''' So it's nice and simple. Just chat to any of the hunters in here to help them out. They're all following reports that I've split up amongst them.
* '''Player:''' Reports?
* '''Guild Scribe Verity:''' Indeed. There are all sorts of interesting creatures to hunt out there. Sometimes we get reports of a particularly unique example. When that happens, one of the hunters will set out to find it.
* '''Guild Scribe Verity:''' If you do decide to take a job from any of the hunters, they'll tell you what type of creature they're looking into. Hunt that creature until you encounter the unique specimen.
* '''Guild Scribe Verity:''' Once you've caught it, bring some proof back to the hunter that sent you out in the first place. I'm sure they'll reward you for your time.
* '''Player:''' I see. Thanks for the information.
* {{tact|end}}

==Standard dialogue==
* '''Guild Scribe Verity:''' Nilsal, hunter. Anything to report?
* '''Player:''' Nothing abnormal today.
* {{tselect|Select an Option}}
* {{topt|What does a scribe do?}}
** '''Player:''' What does a scribe do?
** '''Guild Scribe Verity:''' I'm the primary record-keeper here. I organise all of our reports and write up anything important to be sent back to the city.
** '''Player:''' Do you go out on any hunts with the others?
** '''Guild Scribe Verity:''' I wouldn't know what to do with myself out there, so I like to stay back here with my scrolls.
** {{tact|other}}
* {{topt|How many rumours have I completed?}}
** '''Player:''' How many rumours have I completed?
** '''Guild Scribe Verity:''' Our records suggest you've managed to complete [number of completed rumours] rumours for us!
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|I have this spare hunter gear...}}
** '''Player:''' I have this spare hunter gear, is there anything I can do with it?
** '''Guild Scribe Verity:''' Spare, you say? Hmmm.... I'm sure one of the other hunters could benefit from it if you're sure. If you hand it over to me, I can give you some spare supplies in return.
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|I have to go.}}
** '''Player:''' I have to go.
** {{tact|end}}

