* '''Player:''' Hello.
* '''Hunding:''' What are you doing in our village, outlander?
* {{topt|Nothing much.}}
** '''Player:''' Nothing much.
** '''Hunding:''' Bah! Go down to the longhall, and there you will find excitement aplenty! Our finest warrior, Gunthor the Brave, will give you a rousing welcome!
