** '''Player:''' Where is your counterpart?
** {{tcond|Having completed Twilight's Promise but not The Heart of Darkness:}}
*** '''Jatziri, Teoki of Ralos:''' That I would like to know myself. Tecuani left to attend to business elsewhere in the kingdom, but is yet to return.
*** '''Player:''' That sounds concerning.
*** '''Jatziri, Teoki of Ralos:''' It could well be. It is being looked into, but given the recent events at the Teomat, there are other matters that also require attention.
*** {{tact|continue}}
** {{tcond|Having completed The Final Dawn:}}
