**** {{tact|other}}
*** {{tcond|If the player has completed [[Scrambled!]]:}}
**** '''Jatziri, Teoki of Ralos:''' However, the problem resolved itself in an unexpected way when he sadly fell from atop the temple steps. It seems it was a freak accident.
**** '''Player:''' Yes, I was actually there to witness it myself. It was horrible.
**** '''Jatziri, Teoki of Ralos:''' Let us hope he can at least now find peace with Ranul.
**** {{tact|other}}
** {{tcond|If during [[Scrambled!]]:}}
*** '''Jatziri, Teoki of Ralos:''' Tal Teok is thankfully one of the easier holy sites to look after. However, there is a small issue at the moment in that some tourist has decided to move in and make it their home.
