{{Transcript|npc}}

==Before [[Druidic Ritual]]==
* '''Player:''' Hello there.
* '''Kaqemeex:''' What brings you to our holy monument?
* {{tselect|Select an Option}}
* {{topt|Who are you?}}
** '''Player:''' Who are you?
** '''Kaqemeex:''' We are the druids of Guthix. We worship our god at our famous stone circles. You will find them located throughout these lands.
** {{tselect|Select an Option}}
** {{topt|What about the stone circle full of dark wizards?}}
*** '''Player:''' What about the stone circle full of dark wizards?
*** '''Kaqemeex:''' That used to be OUR stone circle. Unfortunately, many many years ago, dark wizards cast a wicked spell upon it so that they could corrupt its power for their own evil ends.
*** '''Kaqemeex:''' When they cursed the rocks for their rituals they made them useless to us and our magics. We require a brave adventurer to go on a quest for us to help purify the circle of Varrock.
*** {{tselect|Start the Druidic Ritual quest?}}
*** {{topt|Yes.}}
**** {{tact|below}}
*** {{topt|No.}}
**** {{tact|below}}
** {{topt|So what's so good about Guthix?}}
*** '''Player:''' So what's so good about Guthix?
*** '''Kaqemeex:''' Guthix is the oldest and most powerful god in Gielinor. His existence is vital to this world. He is the god of balance, and nature; he is also a very part of this world.
*** '''Kaqemeex:''' He exists in the trees, and the flowers, the water and the rocks. He is everywhere. His purpose is to ensure balance in everything in this world, and as such we worship him.
*** '''Player:''' He sounds kind of boring...
*** '''Kaqemeex:''' Some day when your mind achieves enlightenment you will see the true beauty of his power.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{topt|Well, I'll be on my way now.}}
*** '''Player:''' Well, I'll be on my way now.
*** '''Kaqemeex:''' Goodbye adventurer. I feel we shall meet again.
*** {{Tact|end}}
* {{topt|I'm in search of a quest.}}
** '''Player:''' I'm in search of a quest.
** '''Kaqemeex:''' Hmm. I think I may have a worthwhile quest for you actually. I don't know if you are familiar with the stone circle south of Varrock or not, but...
** '''Kaqemeex:''' That used to be OUR stone circle. Unfortunately, many many years ago, dark wizards cast a wicked spell upon it so that they could corrupt its power for their own evil ends.
** '''Kaqemeex:''' When they cursed the rocks for their rituals they made them useless to us and our magics. We require a brave adventurer to go on a quest for us to help purify the circle of Varrock.
** {{tselect|Start the Druidic Ritual quest?}}
** {{topt|Yes.}}
*** '''Player:''' Okay, I will try and help.
*** '''Kaqemeex:''' Excellent. Go to the village south of this place and speak to my fellow druid, Sanfew, who is working on the purification ritual. He knows what is required to complete it.
*** '''Player:''' Will do.
*** {{tact|end}} 
** {{topt|No.}}
*** '''Player:''' No, that doesn't sound very interesting.
*** '''Kaqemeex:''' I will not try and change your mind adventurer. Some day when you have matured you may reconsider your position. We will wait until then.
*** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Did you build this?}}
