**** '''Le-sabrè:''' bones each day and you'll receive a 7.5% increase in Slayer XP when on assignment in the Slayer Tower. The disciples at the Ectofuntus will give you a bonecrusher too!
**** '''Player:''' Thanks!
**** {{tact|end}}
*** {{topt|Elite Rewards.}}
