==Standard dialogue==
* '''Leagues Assistant:''' Hello there. Do you have any questions about Leagues?
* {{tselect|Select an Option}}
* {{topt|What's a League?}}
** '''Player:''' What's a League?
** '''Leagues Assistant:''' Leagues are time-limited challenges that provide a unique twist on the world you know and love.
** '''Leagues Assistant:''' With each League, you start afresh, with a limited amount of time to progress through the League.
** '''Player:''' A fresh start? Why would I want that?
** '''Leagues Assistant:''' Glory, rewards, and the chance to do things in a different way!
** '''Leagues Assistant:''' First up, the glory. Within a League, you can earn League Points by completing various tasks.
** '''Leagues Assistant:''' The more points you have, the better League Rank you will be given.
** '''Leagues Assistant:''' Each League Rank will unlock a trophy for you. These trophies can be used to show off your accomplishments.
** '''Leagues Assistant:''' If that doesn't interest you, perhaps another reward might be more appealing? League Points can be used to buy things from the Leagues Reward Shop.
** '''Leagues Assistant:''' You can keep these purchases for yourself or sell them on to others!
** '''Player:''' And if glory and rewards don't interest me?
** '''Leagues Assistant:''' Every League has unique rules and features. It's a very different world from the one you're used to.
** '''Leagues Assistant:''' For one thing, within the Leagues, you can unlock powerful artefacts known as Relics which completely change the way you progress.
** '''Leagues Assistant:''' So even if glory and rewards aren't your thing, you'll still find Leagues to be a whole lot of fun!
** '''Player:''' I see, thanks for the information.
** '''Leagues Assistant:''' My pleasure!
** {{tact|initial}}
* {{topt|Is there currently a League running?}}
** '''Player:''' Is there currently a League running?
** '''Leagues Assistant:''' Yes! The current League is Leagues IV: Trailblazer Reloaded.<!-- as of 12 January, she still has this dialogue -->
** '''Leagues Assistant:''' Within this League you are restricted to certain regions around Gielinor - although you'll get to choose which ones.
** '''Leagues Assistant:''' You can also collect powerful artefacts known as Relics. Each one provides a different buff to your League experience.
** '''Leagues Assistant:''' I heard there's one that lets you note items wherever you want, and one that makes shops free!
** '''Leagues Assistant:''' One other thing. You must participate as an Iron Man. This means you stand alone and cannot trade with other participants.
** '''Player:''' Interesting. Maybe I should take part!
** '''Leagues Assistant:''' I'd highly recommend it!
** {{tbox|pic=24360 detail.png|To take part in a League, you must be on a Leagues World. The world switcher in the logout menu can be used to switch worlds.}}
