* {{topt|What changes have been made for this League?}}
** '''Player:''' What changes have been made for this League?
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' All sorts of things! I can't recount all of the information for you, but I can give you the basics though.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' During this League, you are initially restricted to the Kingdom of Misthalin. However, as you progress, you'll be able to unlock new areas of your choosing.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' Be warned though - you won't be able to unlock every area, so choose wisely.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' Now, for the entire League, you must participate as an Iron Man. This means you stand alone and cannot trade with other participants.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' And that's not all. Training skills during the League will grant you substantially more experience than you'd normally expect!
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' Finally, some quests have been completed for you automatically. Further quests will be completed as you unlock the relevant areas.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' I think that covers the basics. Would you like to see some more in-depth information?
** {{topt|Yes, please.}}
*** '''Player:''' Yes, please.
*** {{tact|Trailblazer Info interface opens.}}
** {{topt|Not right now.}}
*** '''Player:''' Not right now.
