*** {{tact|other}}
* {{topt|How do tasks work?}}
** '''Player:''' How do tasks work?
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' In every League, there are a number of tasks for you to complete. Each task has a level of difficulty: Easy, Medium, Hard, Elite and Master.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' Completing tasks allows you to access new areas. The more tasks completed, the more areas available to unlock.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' Not only that, completing tasks also earns you League Points. The number of points earned is dependent on the difficulty of the task.
** '''Player:''' What do these points do?
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' Once you have achieved a certain amount of League Points you can unlock a new Relic! These are powerful artefacts to help you in the League.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' League Points can also be used to buy rewards from the Leagues Reward Shop.
** {{tbox|Right now, you are playing on your Leagues profile. The Leagues Reward Shop can only be opened on your main profile.}}
** {{tbox|You can access your main profile by switching to any normal Old School RuneScape world. The world switcher in the logout menu can be used to switch worlds.}}
** '''Player:''' So how many tasks are there?
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' More than you'll ever be able to complete, most likely. With so many to choose from, it's up to you which ones you go for.
** '''Player:''' Thanks!
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' Not a problem. Now, would you like to take a look at the tasks for this League?
** {{topt|Yes, please.}}
*** '''Player:''' Yes, please.
*** {{tact|Trailblazer Task interface opens.}}
** {{topt|Not right now.}}
*** {{tact|above}}
* {{topt|How does the area system work?}}
** '''Player:''' How does the area system work?
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' In this League, you are initially locked to the Kingdom of Misthalin and the island of Karamja. However, as you progress, you can unlock more areas.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' There are nine different areas in total. However, you can only unlock a maximum of five, including Misthalin and Karamja, so choose wisely.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' The first two area unlocks are given to everyone. However, the other three unlocks are unavailable to begin with.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' You can access these additional area unlocks by completing tasks. The more tasks you've completed, the more areas you can unlock.
** '''Player:''' I see. Thanks!
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' Would you like to take a look at the available areas now?
** {{topt|Yes, please.}}
*** '''Player:''' Yes, please.
*** {{tact|Trailblazer Task interface opens.}}
** {{topt|Not right now.}}
*** {{tact|above}}
* {{topt|What are Relics?}}
** '''Player:''' How does the area system work?
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' Relics, or Trailblazer Relics to give them their full name, are powerful artefacts that grant unique abilities for the entire League!
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' There are eighteen separate Relics, split across six different tiers. You can only have one Relic from each tier though.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' The first Relic tier is available to everyone. However, the higher tiers are locked to begin with.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' You can unlock these higher tiers by earning League Points. League Points are earned by completing tasks.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' Be warned, you'll need to choose carefully when picking a Relic. Once you have selected a Relic, your choice can't be changed for the rest of the League.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' Anyway, it looks like you have a Relic available for selection right now! Would you like to take a look?
** {{topt|Yes, please.}}
*** '''Player:''' Yes, please.
*** {{tact|Trailblazer Relic interface opens.}}
** {{topt|Not right now.}}
*** {{tact|above}}
* {{topt|Tell me about League rewards.}}
** '''Player:''' Tell me about League rewards.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' As well as letting you unlock new areas, completing tasks in the League will earn you League Points. The more League Points you have, the more Trailblazer Relic tiers you have available.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' However, alongside allowing you to unlock Trailblazer Relics, League Points can also be used to buy rewards from the Leagues Reward Shop.
** '''Player:''' What rewards can I buy?
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' All sorts of things! There's some new furniture for your house, an alternate animation for your Home Teleport spell and some new stylish outfits, just to name a few.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' Most of the rewards can be traded with others, so if you want, you can earn some money by selling them on. Of course, you might prefer to keep them for yourself instead.
** '''Player:''' I see. That all sounds good to me.
** {{tbox|Right now, you are playing on your Leagues profile. The Leagues Reward Shop can only be opened on your main profile.}}
** {{tbox|You can access your main profile by switching to any normal Old School RuneScape world. The world switcher in the logout menu can be used to switch worlds.}}
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' One thing to be aware of is that the Trailblazer rewards won't be available until the League has ended. You can still buy rewards from previous Leagues though.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' Now, alongside the rewards in the Leagues Reward Shop, there's also League Ranks.
** '''Player:''' League Ranks? How do they work?
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' At the end of the League, you will be given a League Rank. This is based upon the number of League Points you have earned compared to the other participants.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' Anyone who earns at least 100 League Points will be eligible for the Bronze rank. The top 80% of participants get the Iron rank. The top 60% get Steel.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' The top 40% get Mithril. The top 20% get Adamant. The top 5% get Rune. The best participants, those who make it to the top 1%, get the Dragon rank!
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' When the League ends, your rank will determine what trophy you get. These trophies symbolise your performance in the League.
** '''Player:''' Trophies?
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' That's right. Trophies are items that are given to you after the League. You can use them to show off your League Rank!
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' Connected to League Ranks are the League to League rewards. These are unlocked in the next League based upon the League Rank you earn in this one!
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' League Starter Outfits and League Icons are some of things you can unlock for the next League. Also, any pets you earn in this League will transfer over to the next one.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' Finally, on top of the tasks for this League, there are some other activities for which I will recognise the first person who completes them.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' You can view the entire list of activities, as well as whether or not someone has completed them, by reading the board beside me.
** '''Player:''' Thanks!
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' Not a problem. Now, is there anything else I can help you with?
** {{tact|other}}
