** '''Player:''' Let's talk about pets.
** '''Player:''' Can you tell me how pets work in Leagues?
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' Of course! If you're lucky enough to obtain a pet during a League, it will automatically be insured for you.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' This means that if you were to ever lose it, you can talk to me and I'll give it back to you. Insurance and reclaiming is all free!
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' Additionally, each pet you obtain will be transferred to the next League. It'll be waiting with me for you to reclaim it!
** '''Player:''' Okay! Thank you.
** '''Leagues Tutor:''' No worries. Come back to me once you have some pets and you can view your collection! Now, is there anything else I can help you with?
