* {{topt|How do I get a fight?}}
** '''Player:''' How do I get a fight?
** '''Mubariz:''' You can participate in Duels and Tournaments. These may be ranked, if you want rewards and prestige, or unranked if you're just fighting your friends for fun.
** {{tbox|pic=Grouping icon.png|This is the icon for the {{colour|#7f0000|Grouping}} tab. Within it you'll find the {{colour|#7f0000|PvP Arena}} options.}}
** {{tbox|pic=Grouping icon.png|There, you can click {{colour|#7f0000|Find}} to seek the official group for ranked Duels or Tournaments.}}
** {{tbox|pic=Grouping icon.png|Once you've found it, click {{colour|#7f0000|Sign up}} to sign up to one, and you'll be considered for an invitation to a Duel or Tournament, whenever one begins.}}
** {{tbox|Ranked Duels and Tournaments take place on designated worlds, with stats and items provided to you on those worlds.}}
** '''Mubariz:''' Win or lose, you'll earn Reward Points for taking part in ranked Duels and Tournaments. You can trade your points here for supplies that might help in the Wilderness, or such places.
** '''Mubariz:''' Now, if you want to choose your opponents, you can have an unranked Duel or Tournament instead, just for the fun of beating them.
** '''Mubariz:''' Use the recruitment boards outside the hospital to set up your own unranked tournament, or to apply to an existing one.
** '''Mubariz:''' For an unranked Duel, look around the Arena for someone you wish to fight, and challenge them...
** {{tbox|You'll see a 'Challenge' option when you right-click other people around the Arena. Use that to set up an unranked Duel.}}
** {{tbox|On PvP Arena worlds the Arena will supply stats and items for your fight. You'll get to choose your load-out from a menu.}}
** {{tbox|On other worlds, like this one, you must bring your own items, and fight with your own stats.}}
