** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Are your pickaxes better than other pickaxes, then?}}
** '''Player:''' Are your pickaxes better than other pickaxes, then?
** '''Nurmof:''' Of course they are! My pickaxes are made of higher grade metal than your ordinary bronze pickaxes, allowing you to mine that ore just a little bit faster than normal.
** {{tact|end}}

==With a [[dragon pickaxe (broken)]] in inventory==
* '''Player:''' Hi Nurmof, I found this earlier...
* '''Nurmof:''' Oh, a dragon pickaxe! And a broken one at that. I haven't seen one of those in a while.
* '''Player:''' Can you fix it for me? I was told you're the dwarf to see!
* '''Nurmof:''' I did indeed fix pickaxes in the past, many years ago. They were a lot more common back then.
* '''Nurmof:''' In fact, this is the first broken pickaxe I've seen in a very long time!
* '''Player:''' Why were there so many broken pickaxes back then?
* '''Nurmof:''' Ore rocks used to be quite unstable. They would randomly explode when you were mining them.
* '''Player:''' That sounds terrifying!
* '''Nurmof:''' It was. But then one day, the explosions just... stopped. As if someone flipped an off switch somewhere.
* '''Nurmof:''' I've not seen a broken pickaxe since then!
* '''Player:''' Will you still be able to fix mine for me?
* '''Nurmof:''' I should think so. I'll need to buy some new tools.
* '''Nurmof:''' They're quite expensive, but they will get the job done. The pickaxe will be as good as new when I've finished with it.
* '''Nurmof:''' The cost will be about...
* '''Nurmof:''' ...let me see. I need another one of these, and I can reuse that if I replace the drill bit from there...
* '''Nurmof:''' ...hmm, and this needs a full clean, oh and I don't have one of those anymore...
* '''Nurmof:''' ...okay! It'll cost about 2,500,000 GP, give or take a few coins. Would you like me to fix it for you?
* {{tselect|Pay Nurmof 2,500,000 GP to fix your dragon pickaxe?}}
* {{topt|Yes, let's do it.}}
** '''Player:''' Yes, let's do it.
** '''Nurmof:''' Lovely! Okay, give me a moment. It may take a little while, it's a tough metal to work with.
** {{tcond|If the player has at least 2,500,000 gp in their inventory:}}
*** {{tbox|Nurmof goes into a nearby hidden room, and from within, you hear the sound of a hammer striking metal.}}
*** {{tbox|..he did say it would take a little while.}}
*** {{tbox|pic=Dragon pickaxe detail.png|Nurmof hands you the repaired dragon pickaxe.}}
*** '''Nurmof:''' There you go, good as new, just like I said!
*** '''Player:''' Thank you very much. I'll take good care of it.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If the player has less than 2,500,000 gp in their inventory:}}
*** '''Player:''' Oh, I actually don't have enough coins on me! I'll come back with more.
*** '''Nurmof:''' I'll be here!
*** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|That's rather expensive...}}
** '''Player:''' That's rather expensive...
** '''Nurmof:''' It is! But you can't cheap out on quality. If a job's worth doing, do it well.
** '''Nurmof:''' I'm also the only one who can repair pickaxes these days, so you don't really have much choice!
** {{tselect|Pay Nurmof 2,500,000 GP to fix your dragon pickaxe?}}
** {{topt|Okay then, let's do it.}}
*** '''Player:''' Okay then, let's do it.
*** {{tact|above}}
** {{topt|I'll think about it.}}
*** '''Player:''' I'll think about it.
*** '''Nurmof:''' I'll be here!
*** {{tact|end}}

