Transcript:Pirate Jackie the Fruit.wikitext:
{{Transcript|npc}}

==Standard dialogue==
* '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' Ahoy!
* {{topt|What is this place?}}
** '''Player:''' What is this place?
** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' Welcome to the Brimhaven Agility Arena!
** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' If ye want to know more talk to Cap'n Izzy, he found it!
** {{tact|previous}}
* {{topt|What do you do?}}
** '''Player:''' What do you do?
** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' I be the Jack o' Tickets. I exchange the tickets ye collect in the Agility Arena for more stuff. Ye can obtain more agility experience or some items ye won't find anywhere else!
** '''Player:''' Sounds good!
** {{tact|previous}}
* {{topt|I'd like to trade in my tickets, please.}}
** '''Player:''' I'd like to trade in my tickets, please.
** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' Aye, ye be on the right tack.
** {{tcond|If the player has both old and new tickets:}}
*** {{tselect|You have both old and new tickets, which shop do you want to open?}}
*** {{topt|New Shop}}
**** {{tact|opens=Agility Arena Store}}
*** {{topt|Old Shop}}
**** {{tact|opens=Brimhaven Agility Arena Ticket Exchange}}
** {{tcond|Otherwise:}}
*** {{tact|opens=Agility Arena Store}}
* {{topt|I have a question about my Achievement Diary.}}
** '''Player:''' I have a question about my Achievement Diary.
** {{tcond|After completing easy tier:}}
*** '''Player:''' I've done all the easy tasks in my Karamja Achievement Diary.
*** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' Arr, ye have that, I see yer list. I s'pose ye'll be wantin' yer reward then!
*** '''Player:''' Yes please.
**** {{tcond|If the player's inventory does not have at least 2 free inventory spaces:}}
***** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' Arrr, ye'll 'ave ta come back when ye has more space in yer pack.
***** {{tact|end}}
*** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' These 'ere Karamja gloves be a symbol of yer explorin' on the island. I'll 'ave a word with some of the seafarin' folk who sail to Port Sarim and Ardougne, so they'll take ye on board half price if ye be wearin' them.
*** {{tact|below}}
** {{tcond|After completing medium tier:}}
*** '''Player:''' I've done all the medium tasks in my Karamja Achievement Diary.
*** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' Arr, so ye have. I s'pose ye'll be wantin' yer reward upgraded then!
*** '''Player:''' Yes please.
*** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' The enchantment on these 'ere Karamja gloves be a symbol of yer further explorin' on the island. They'll take ye to an underground mine in Shilo,{{sic|The Karamja gloves 2 do not have a teleport option.}} Cap'n Izzy's arranged it so ye gets a little extra benefit in our
*** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' Agility Arena. Ye can have this lamp too.
*** '''Player:''' Wow, thanks!
*** {{tact|below}}
** {{tcond|After completing hard tier:}}
*** '''Player:''' I've done all the hard tasks in my Karamja Achievement Diary.
*** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' Arr, so ye have. I s'pose ye'll be wantin' yer reward upgraded again!
*** '''Player:''' Yes please.
*** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' The enchantment on these 'ere Karamja gloves be a symbol of yer exhaustive explorin'. They'll take ye to a mine under Shilo Village now infinitely, an' all the merchants will give ye discounts. Ye can have this lamp
*** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' too.
*** '''Player:''' Wow, thanks!
*** {{tact|below}}
** {{tcond|After completing elite tier:}}
*** '''Player:''' I've done all the elite tasks in my Karamja Achievement Diary.
*** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' Arr, that be an incredible achievement, so it be! I suppose ye'll be wanting yer reward upgraded again.
*** '''Player:''' Yes please.
*** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' The enchantment on these 'ere Karamja gloves be the ultimate symbol of yer exhaustive explorin'. Ye'll now get double TokKul from the Fight Cave, Inferno an' TzHaar-Ket-Rak's Challenges.
*** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' Ye'll have a chance for double tickets in our Agility Arena 'ere. Ye can resurrect in the Fight Cave once per day, an' even enter some places fer<!--sic--> free.
*** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' I can make the metal dragons under Brimhaven give ye bars as banknotes too, if ye likes.
*** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' Ye can have that lamp too.
*** '''Player:''' Wow, thanks!
*** {{tact|below}}
** {{topt|What is the Achievement Diary?}}
*** '''Player:''' What is the Achievement Diary?
*** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' Arrr, it be a diary that tracks yer achievements on Karamja. Once ye've explored enough, I give ye some enchanted gloves, an' the people of Karamja reward ye for yer hard work.
*** {{tact|previous}}
** {{topt|What are the rewards?}}
*** {{tact|below}}
** {{topt|See you later.}}
*** {{tact|below}}
** {{topt|Can I have another set of Karamja gloves?}}
*** {{tact|below}}
** {{topt|What are the rewards?}}
*** '''Player:''' What are the rewards?
*** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' Arrr, that depends what tier ye wants to know about.
*** {{topt|Easy rewards}}
**** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' Ye gets a pair of special Karamja gloves. The seafarin' folk who sail to Port Sarim and Ardougne will take ye on board half price if ye be wearin' them.
**** {{tact|previous}}
*** {{topt|Medium rewards}}
**** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' Arrr, I upgrade the Karamja gloves so ye gets a little extra benefit in our Agility Arena with 'em on, and now they'll take ye to the special mine under Shilo Village, an ye still gets the easy rewards too.
**** {{tact|previous}}
*** {{topt|Hard rewards}}
**** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' Arrr, I upgrade the Karamja gloves so they can take ye to a special mine under Shilo Village infinitely. Ye still gets the easy and medium rewards too.
**** {{tact|previous}}
*** {{topt|Elite rewards}}
**** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' Arrr, ye can get double TokKul from the Fight Cave, Inferno an' TzHaar-Ket-Rak's Challenges, an' have a chance for double tickets in our Agility Arena 'ere.
**** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' Ye can resurrect in the Fight Cave once per day, an' even enter some places fer free.
**** '''Pirate Jackie the Fruit:''' I can make the metal dragons under Brimhaven give ye bars as banknotes too, if ye likes. Ye still gets the easy, medium an' hard rewards too.
**** {{tact|previous}}
*** {{topt|Cancel}}
**** {{tact|previous2}}
** {{tcond|If the player has already claimed a Karamja diary reward:}}
*** {{topt|Can I have another set of Karamja gloves?}}
