* '''Player:''' Yes, I thought as much. What did she have to say?
* '''Postie Pete:''' First she said 'I am the Oracle, And when I open my lips, let no dog bark!'
* '''Player:''' I see. And then what?
* '''Postie Pete:''' I didn't know she was familiar with the works of Shakespeare. So I said 'Et tu, brute?'
* '''Player:''' And then?
* '''Postie Pete:''' Well, she started leaping about and pointing to Ardougne, shouting something about betrayal. She was really angry.
* '''Player:''' Cripes! What do you think it means?
* '''Postie Pete:''' Who knows. Always cryptic to the last. See you around.
* {{tact|end}}

