* '''Ranger (medium):''' Ahhh, two tentacles!
* '''Ranger (medium):''' ...three tentacles!
* '''Ranger (medium):''' I think I'm going to faint!
* '''Ranger (medium):''' Blimey! Look at that beast! You're gonna have to sort that thing out on your own!
