**** '''Player:''' Yes please.
**** '''Smith:''' Right, let's get to work.
**** '''Smith:''' There ye go, good as new!
**** '''Player:''' Thanks Smith!
**** {{tact|end}}
*** {{topt|No}}
**** '''Player:''' No.
**** '''Smith:''' Well I'll still be here if ye change yer mind.
**** {{tact|end}}

