** {{tact|initial}}
* {{topt|How do you like your town?}}
** '''Player:''' How do you like your town?
** '''Sorin:''' It's just perfect, thanks so much for your efforts.
** {{tact|initial}}
* {{topt|What's happening around here?}}
** '''Player:''' What's happening around here?
** '''Sorin:''' Oh, not much really, we're all still hiding from the vampyres and eking out a living from this terrible place, hopefully soon we'll be strong enough to make the journey to the temple on the Salve.
** {{tact|initial}}
* {{topt|Is there anything I can do to help out?}}
** '''Player:''' Is there anything I can do to help out?
** '''Sorin:''' Not as far as I know, we have some basic amenities now which is so very useful, we're all incredibly grateful to you. I've never really seen or known a hero before, so I have nothing to compare one to, but I suspect in
** '''Sorin:''' most people's judgement, you would be one! I for one am very pleased to have met you.
** {{tact|initial}}
* {{topt|Ok, thanks.}}
** '''Player:''' Ok, thanks.
** {{tact|end}}

==After The Blood Moon Rises==
* '''Sorin:''' Hey, it's the hero! Thank you so much for everything you've done, not just for us, but for all of Morytania!
* '''Player:''' You're more than welcome.
* {{tselect|Select an option}}
* {{topt|What do you do here?}}
** '''Player:''' What do you do here?
** '''Sorin:''' My name's Sorin. I'm just trying to make do I guess. The vampyres might not be a problem, but there's still no shortage of dangers around here.
** {{tact|other}}
* {{topt|How are thing's here?}}
** '''Player:''' How are thing's here?
** '''Sorin:''' Well, I'd be lying if I said life was suddenly perfect, but it's nice to no longer live in constant fear of the vampyres.
** '''Player:''' What will you do now that you don't have to worry about them?
** '''Sorin:''' Well, quite a few of us are working on making the town a bit nicer. Not that there's anything wrong with the work you did of course.
** '''Sorin:''' Some of the others don't want to stick around. They reckon it might be safe enough to make the journey up to Paterdomus now. I think they want to start a new life across the Salve.
** '''Player:''' Is there anything I can do to help out?
** '''Sorin:''' With the town? No, I don't think so. You've done enough to help us anyway.
** '''Sorin:''' I suppose if you did want to help in some way though, you could maybe assist those who want to get to Paterdomus. The swamps can still be pretty dangerous.
** '''Player:''' I'll keep that in mind.
** {{tact|other}}
* {{topt|I'd best be off.}}
** '''Player:''' I'd best be off.
** {{tact|end}}

