Transcript:Tool Leprechaun.wikitext:
{{Transcript|npc}}

==Standard dialogue==
* '''Tool Leprechaun:''' Ah, 'tis a foine day to be sure! Were yez wantin' me to store yer tools, or maybe ye might be wantin' yer stuff back from me?
* {{topt|cond=When talking to the Weiss Leprechaun:|Why are you here in Weiss?}}
** '''Player:''' Why are you here in Weiss?
** '''Tool Leprechaun:''' An' why would I not be here? Now that there be farming patches, there'll be folk needing a leprechaun to hold their stuff! So, dod ye want to be using the store?
** {{tact|initial}}
* {{topt|Yes please.}}
** {{tact|opens=Tool Leprechaun{{!}}Amazing Farming Equipment Store}}
* {{topt|What can you store?}}
** '''Player:''' What can you store?
** '''Tool Leprechaun:''' We'll hold onto yer rake, yer seed dibber, yer spade, yer secateurs, yer waterin' can and yer trowel - but mind it's not one of them fancy trowels only archaeologists use!
** '''Tool Leprechaun:''' We'll take a few buckets off yer hands too, and even yer compost, supercompost an' ultracompost! Also plant cure vials.
** '''Tool Leprechaun:''' Aside from that, if ye hands me yer farming produce, I can mebbe change it into banknotes for ye.
** '''Tool Leprechaun:''' So... do ye want to be using the store?
** {{tact|other}}
* {{topt|What do you do with the tools you're storing?}}
** '''Player:''' What do you do with the tools you're storing? They can't possibly all fit in your pockets!
** '''Tool Leprechaun:''' We leprechauns have a shed where we keep 'em. It's a magic shed, so ye can get yer items back from any of us leprechauns whenever ye want. Saves ye havin' to carry loads of stuff around the country!
** '''Tool Leprechaun:''' So... do ye want to be using the store?
** {{tact|other}}
* {{topt|No thanks, I'll keep hold of my stuff.}}
** '''Player:''' No thanks, I'll keep hold of my stuff.
** '''Tool Leprechaun:''' Ye must be dafter than ye look if ye likes luggin' yer tools everywhere ye goes!
** {{tact|end}}

