Transcript:Torrell.wikitext:
{{Transcript|npc}}
{{Incomplete}}

==Standard dialogue==
* {{tselect|Select an option}}
* {{topt|Would you look after my crops for me?}}
** {{tact|If the player has no crops planted.}}
*** '''Player:''' Would you look after my crops for me?
*** '''Torrell:''' You don't have a sapling planted in that patch. Plant one and I might agree to look after it for you.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tact|If the player has already paid for the crop.}}
