* {{topt|Tell me about the Rules of Conduct.}}
** '''Player:''' Tell me about the Rules of Conduct.
** '''Town crier:''' At once. Take a look at my book here...
** {{tact|opens2=Rules}}
* {{topt|Can you give me a handy tip please?}}
** '''Player:''' Can you give me a handy tip please?
** {{trandom}}
** {{topt|Dialogue 1}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Did you know most skills have right click 'Make-X' options to help you train faster?
** {{topt|Dialogue 2}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Make your recovery questions and answers hard to guess but easy to remember.
** {{topt|Dialogue 3}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Don't use your RuneScape password on other sites. Keep your account safe!
** {{topt|Dialogue 4}}
*** '''Town crier:''' If you think someone knows your password - change it!
** {{topt|Dialogue 5}}
*** '''Town crier:''' The squirrels! The squirrels are coming! Noooo, get them out of my head!
** {{topt|Dialogue 6}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Did you know you burn food less often on the range in Lumbridge castle than other ranges?
** {{topt|Dialogue 7}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Players can not trim armour. Don't fall for this popular scam!
** {{topt|Dialogue 8}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Feeling harassed? Don't forget your ignore list can be especially useful if a player seems to be picking on you!
** {{topt|Dialogue 9}}
*** '''Town crier:''' If you're lost and have no idea where to go, use the Home Teleport spell for free!
** {{topt|Dialogue 10}}
*** '''Town crier:''' If you see someone breaking the rules, report them!
** {{topt|Dialogue 11}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Did you know? Superheat Item means you never fail to smelt ore!
** {{topt|Dialogue 12}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Did you know that at high levels of Runecrafting you get more than one rune per essence?
** {{topt|Dialogue 13}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Never lend your items out unless you expect them not to come back.
** {{topt|Dialogue 14}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Never question a penguin.
** {{topt|Dialogue 15}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Melee armour actually gives you disadvantages when using magic attacks. It may be better to take off your armour entirely!
** {{topt|Dialogue 16}}
*** '''Town crier:''' If the chat window is moving too quickly to report a player accurately, run to a quiet spot and review the chat at your leisure!
** {{topt|Dialogue 17}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Take time to check the second trade window carefully. Don't be scammed!
** {{topt|Dialogue 18}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Did you know having a bank pin can help secure your valuable items?
** {{topt|Dialogue 19}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Did you know that mithril equipment is very light?
** {{topt|Dialogue 20}}
*** '''Town crier:''' There are no cheats in RuneScape! Never visit websites promising otherwise!
** {{topt|Dialogue 21}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Jagex will never e-mail you. Do not believe any e-mails that claim to be from us.
** {{topt|Dialogue 22}}
*** '''Town crier:''' If you're stuck on a skill, talk to the Lumbridge Tutors for help and tips.
** {{topt|Dialogue 23}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Did you know that you can wear a shield with a crossbow?
** {{topt|Dialogue 24}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Beware of players trying to lure you into the wilderness. Your items cannot be returned if you lose them!
** {{topt|Dialogue 25}}
*** '''Town crier:''' If a player isn't sure of the rules, send them to me! I'll be happy to remind them!
** {{topt|Dialogue 26}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Never tell your password to anyone, not even your best friend!
** {{topt|Dialogue 27}}
*** '''Town crier:''' Be careful when fighting wizards! Wearing heavy armour can lower your Magic resistance!
** '''Town crier:''' Is there anything else you'd like to know?
