{{Transcript|npc}}

==Standard dialogue==
===If the player has not yet asked about the crew===
* '''Player:''' Hello! What brings you here?
* '''Zombie pirate:''' I'm here to guard this ship from any scurvy dogs darin' to loot her cargo.
* '''Player:''' How did your ship end up here?
* '''Zombie pirate:''' Arr, 'tis a woeful tale.
* '''Zombie pirate:''' Me hearties and I were enjoying a bit o' grog when we espied a group of landlubbers fightin' on the shore. 'Twas such an exciting battle that our navigator forgot to watch for the rocks.
* '''Zombie pirate:''' Now we've run aground, as ye can see.
* {{tselect|Select an Option}}
* {{topt|Where's the rest of your crew?}}
** '''Player:''' Where's the rest of your crew?
** '''Zombie pirate:''' They're searchin' for booty at that temple to the west.
** '''Player:''' Will they return to the ship?
** '''Zombie pirate:''' They best do! That scurvy lot keep fillin' their lockers with loot and sneakin' off without swappin' places!
** {{tselect|Select an Option}}
** {{topt|Do you really want to go to the temple?}}
*** '''Player:''' Do you really want to go to the temple? I've heard the mages there have some really annoying spells.
*** '''Zombie pirate:''' Nothin' we can't handle! We've a way of stoppin' their tricksy teleports.
*** '''Player:''' How can a group of mindless zombies invent a counter to magic?
*** '''Zombie pirate:''' What we lack in brains, we make up for in gold! We found us a landlubber willin' to share their knowledge... for a price.
*** '''Zombie pirate:''' They wrote us down a spell on some magic scrolls. All we 'ave to do is read one, and then we're properly anchored! Those mages can't teleport us anywhere!
*** '''Player:''' Wow, I'm actually impressed. Do you think your friends at the temple will lend me one?
*** '''Zombie pirate:''' Naw, they're too busy fightin' to talk to the likes of ye. Besides, we stash all our spare scrolls in these lockers for safekeepin'.
*** '''Player:''' Can I take a scroll from a locker, then?
*** '''Zombie pirate:''' Ye'll need a key for that, matey! One of the crew should 'ave one.
*** '''Zombie pirate:''' And when ye see 'em, tell 'em it's their turn to keep watch!
*** '''Zombie pirate:''' There be plenty o' loot in them lockers, matey. Don't expect to find a scroll right away.
*** '''Player:''' Thanks. I'd say 'see you around', but I sort of hope I don't.
*** '''Zombie pirate:''' Aye, the feelin's mutual.
** {{topt|Goodbye.}}
*** '''Player:''' Goodbye, I hope your crew comes back soon.
*** '''Zombie pirate:''' Arr, me too matey.
*** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Goodbye.}}
** '''Player:''' Goodbye.
** '''Zombie pirate:''' Bye, matey.
** {{tact|end}}

