Transcript:Zul-Cheray.wikitext:
{{Transcript|npc}}

==Standard dialogue==
* '''Zul-Cheray:''' You queue-jumper! My eldest son was chosen as a sacrifice to Zulrah, but now the priests say you're going to sacrifice yourself first.
* {{topt|You're angry that I've saved your son's life?}}
** '''Player:''' You're angry that I've saved your son's life?
** '''Zul-Cheray:''' The sacrifice is the greatest honour to which any of us can aspire! He was so excited to be coming face-to-face with Zulrah, and offering himself on behalf of the tribe.
** '''Zul-Cheray:''' Also, I won't get the extra large ration of sacred swamp eels if my son doesn't make the sacrifice. Shame on you!
** '''Player:''' I see.
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|I'm sorry.}}
** '''Player:''' I'm sorry.
** '''Zul-Cheray:''' Quite right. Now get on with sacrificing yourself.
** {{tact|end}}

===Talking to her before offering yourself as a sacrifice===
* '''Zul-Cheray:''' Have you heard? My eldest son has been chosen as a sacrifice to the mighty Zulrah!
* {{topt|How do you feel about that?}}
** '''Player:''' How do you feel about that?
** '''Zul-Cheray:''' Oh, it's such an honour. He's so excited to be coming face-to-face with Zulrah, and offering himself on behalf of the tribe.
** '''Zul-Cheray:''' Also, when the sacrifice is made, his brother and I will get an extra large ration of the sacred swamp eels that Zul-Onan catches. I can't wait!
** {{topt|Don't you mind that your son will die?}}
*** '''Player:''' Don't you mind that your son will die?
*** '''Zul-Cheray:''' It's the greatest honour to which any of us can aspire! I only hope that the High Priestess will one day choose me.
*** '''Player:''' I see.
*** '''Zul-Cheray:''' The extra large ration of sacred swamp eels will be nice too.
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{topt|I'm off.}}
*** {{tact|below}}
* {{topt|I'm off.}}
** '''Player:''' I'm off.
** {{tact|end}}

